tml":"Theorem 18.6.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"564"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"584"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(U\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U\">\\(\\Omega_U\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NGeneric}(A,1)\">\\(\\operatorname{NGeneric}(A,1)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqsubseteq\">\\(\\sqsubseteq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"801a9dba9cbba1c7\" href=\"?note=801a9dba9cbba1c7\" title=\"43-df-prefix\">43-df-prefix</a>。域为 Cantor 乘积拓扑，值域为实数通常拓扑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NGeneric}(A,1)\\iff\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall B\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(A\\upharpoonright n\\sqsubseteq B\\Rightarrow|\\Omega_U^B-\\Omega_U^A|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NGeneric}(A,1)\\iff\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall B\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(A\\upharpoonright n\\sqsubseteq B\\Rightarrow|\\Omega_U^B-\\Omega_U^A|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定任意通用 U 后成立。非泛型 A 附近能找到某个 c.e. 开集中的 oracle，使统一模拟的机器额外停机并产生固定概率跳跃。原文 (i)⇒(ii) 中 r 的方向及末式有排印不一致，本项保留明确的等价定理陈述而未认证其逐字证明。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Theorem 18.6.2，印刷页 564，PDF 页 584。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-genericity]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefix","status":"resolved","id":"801a9dba9cbba1c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefix]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$；$A\\in2^\\omega$。$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]；$\\operatorname{NGeneric}(A,1)$ 见 [[43-df-genericity]]；$\\sqsubseteq$ 见 [[43-df-prefix]]。域为 Cantor 乘积拓扑，值域为实数通常拓扑。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$；$A\\in2^\\omega$。$\\Omega_U$ 见 [[43-df-omega-operator]]；$\\operatorname{NGeneric}(A,1)$ 见 [[43-df-